ginger was soaked in 100 mL of 20 mM phosphate buffer pH 6.5
in a chiller at 4 oC and homogenized by using an ice-cold steel
blender in the same buffer. The supernatant (juice fraction) was
recovered and centrifuged at 10,000 x g for 10 min. The clear
