Takeru Kumabe, Seiya Kawasaki, Maki Kushimoto, and Jun Suda
are with the Department of Electronics, Nagoya University, Nagoya
464-8603, Japan (e-mail: kumabe@nagoya-u.jp).
Akira Yoshikawa is with the Advanced Devices Technology Center,
