increasing indium concentration. The rocking curve full
width at half maximum (FWHM) is ~325 arcsec, suggesting
the high crystalline quality of the grown films. We also used
STEM to examine the film and interface structure. Crosssectional specimens were prepared using the Thermo Fisher
Scientific Helios G4 UX focused ion beam system. Highangle annular dark-field (HAADF) images were captured
