caps showing 1.1 ± 1.4 to 7.6 ± 3.1 (0.02–14 mg kg-1 dw)
and stipes from 0.82 ± 0.71 to 3.8 ± 1.8 (0.03–6.7 mg
kg-1 dw; n = 173).
