Environmental surveillance
of commonly‑grown vegetables
for investigating potential lead and chromium
contamination intensification in Bangladesh
A. M. M. Maruf Hossain1,3*, M. Shahidul Islam2, M. Mustafa Mamun1, H. M. Al‑Jonaed1, M. Imran1,
