wiki/sources/islam2024-heavy-metals-bangladeshi-fruits-review.md:49:Total target hazard quotient (TTHQ) exceeded 1 for 7 fruits (banana, mango, jackfruit, papaya, guava, pineapple, strawberry), with guava (9.43), mango (8.25), and papaya (8.04) highest. Combined hazard index (HI) across all fruits = 45.93. Total cancer risk for Cd ranked highest (0.037) followed by Ni (0.024) and As (0.013); only Pb was within the acceptable TR level.
