wiki/sources/belabid2025-canned-tomato-pineapple-trace-elements.md:29:This preprint measured trace elements in canned tomato paste and canned pineapple marketed in Algeria. It is routeable for canned tomato and canned fruit context because it reports Cd exceedance counts and measured trace-element concentrations in canned foods.
wiki/sources/belabid2025-canned-tomato-pineapple-trace-elements.md:33:- The study analyzed 52 canned food samples: tomato paste and pineapple.
wiki/sources/belabid2025-canned-tomato-pineapple-trace-elements.md:46:The source supports canned tomato paste and canned pineapple occurrence context for Cd, Pb, Zn, Cu, and Fe. Because it is a preprint, its values should be weighted below peer-reviewed market surveys until publication status is confirmed.
