wiki/sources/beyene2023-australian-fires-breast-milk.md:69:- [[metals/selenium]]
wiki/sources/nencioni2026-zeolite-cream-metal-adsorption.md:96:- `metals: [Cd, Co, Cr, Pb, Ni]` uses total-Cr (not Cr-VI) per [[docs/conventions]] Part 14 speciation discipline: ICP-OES quantifies total chromium without inorganic-vs-organic Cr-VI speciation (Section 2.3, p. 3). No Hg or As analytes were measured.
